ests.tex`.\n\n### Description\n- Add the general POVM projection inequality, conjugate-isometry transfer estimates and unit-ancilla embedding/intertwining results, with five explicitly auxiliary blueprint entries.\n- Preserve the original proof-module blobs and historical audit evidence. Reconcile the gap note with the source-facing extraction-witness composition already on main, while distinguishing the generic transfer results from the remaining concrete isometry and final soundness obligations.\n- Keep the source-facing `pauli_soundness` statement and its existing proof gap. The scalar square-root error bound already on main is reused.\n\n### Testing\n- The author packet passed focused Lean checks and targeted module builds, ten public and two private standard-only axiom probes, blueprint rendering and declaration synchronization, rooted axiom and paper-gap checks, and normal commit hooks.\n- The subsequent gap-note refresh passed its note, registry, blueprint and merge-loss checks plus 699 workflow tests with 9 skipped through the normal hooks. Four key proof/audit blobs remained unchanged.\n- MAIN verified a clean, conflict-free refresh to `88d73454` on published main `b6c09eb0`. All four key proof/audit blobs and the complete 50,985-byte normalized contribution are unchanged. The duplicate check found none of the ten public declarations already on main. Current publication-head CI and fresh independent review remain pending; original PR #536 and issue #529 remain open.\n\n---\nAddresses #529\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T05:54:14Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T05:54:16Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "2deb42658f0633e2c14238efab719f416cab76d9", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description"