bes, blueprint rendering and declaration synchronization, rooted axiom and paper-gap checks, and normal commit hooks.\n- The subsequent gap-note refresh passed its note, registry, blueprint and merge-loss checks plus 699 workflow tests with 9 skipped through the normal hooks. Four key proof/audit blobs remained unchanged.\n- MAIN verified a clean, conflict-free refresh to `88d73454` on published main `b6c09eb0`. All four key proof/audit blobs and the complete 50,985-byte normalized contribution are unchanged. The duplicate check found none of the ten public declarations already on main. Current publication-head CI and fresh independent review remain pending; original PR #536 and issue #529 remain open.\n\n---\nAddresses #529\n", "publication_logs": [{"path": "/tmp/pr536-publication-open-20260918.log", "sha256": "56c2799e32bf4b8c4d4c9bbaf7fe6b6122e4b1280373bd9b2ff0d194a08999d0", "tail": "594"}, {"path": "/tmp/pr536-publication-module-20260918.log", "sha256": "67e4afdf43184be3d55983b526261495042efccff956a58b4f972fbbd96dd4a4", "tail": "  • [Fintype X] (#4)\n\nConsider replacing this hypothesis with the corresponding instance of `Finite` and using `Fintype.ofFinite` in the proof, or removing it entirely.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.unusedFintypeInType false`\n✔ [8769/8771] Built MIPStarRE.QPBT.Test.Soundness.RangeProjection (6.3s)\n✔ [8770/8771] Built MIPStarRE.QPBT.Test.Soundness.Ancilla (6.1s)\n⚠ [8771/8771] Built MIPStarRE.QPBT.Test.Soundness (4.0s)\nwarning: MIPStarRE/QPBT/Test/Soundness.lean:42:8: declaration uses `sorry`\nBuild completed successfully (8771 jobs)."}], "target_build_exit": 0, "target_build_jobs": 8771, "CI": "running", "independent_review": "pending", "claims_held": ["main-update536", "main-update594"]}
